rk item 56916  and this is the new test method for  determination of metals in biodiesel  in organic mode by mpaes  and so this is really exciting so we've  already done the ios  and we are working through the comments  of the reviewers right now and so  hopefully very soon  this will be also a final method at astm  just a little bit of background on this  method if you've got time  um so this started um from our close  work  with um one of the researchers uh teresa  allman  at enroll which is the national  renewable energy laboratory  and she's on the committee for biofuels  and that committee needed a method  that could analyze metals in their  biofuels  so working with teresa and the group we  were able to come up with this method  that meets elder needs  so that was very exciting and another  exciting thing is  theresa and her group at nrel they've  recently  published this technical report where  they used our mpaes  and this method that we developed with  them and they've  um published it on their nrel website so  if anybody's interested they could go  check out this  technical report where they use this  method  to look at biodiesel blends  so in real life uh samples so it was  really good  very interesting i think that's a very  exciting news  that um like all the more renewable  research in our  mpaes are able to participate in that  yeah so adding elemental analysis to  something that traditionally hasn't had  it but also providing  an instrument that's really easy to use  so traditional users  actually can get up and running as fast  as possible  yeah and i actually went to theresa's  lab to train her on how to use the mpa  yes  and she this was like a totally new  technology for her i mean she's an  extremely  bright researcher and you know  you know one of the best in her field  but this was all new for her and she  caught on  you know i think i was there for two  days and she she was able to run the  instrument and you know produce all this  data  and 